# Kaseis Core

## Stack

Nuxt 4 · Nuxt UI · Better Auth · Railway (web, worker, Postgres, Redis) · Kapso (WhatsApp) · Cloudflare R2 · Sentry · GitHub.

Do not introduce Clerk, WorkOS, Vercel-as-app-host, AWS-as-primary, Cloudflare Workers as primary app, Astro, or Next.js unless explicitly requested.

## Architecture

- Hexagonal feature modules under `packages/modules/<feature>/`
- Composition root only in `packages/di`
- Persistence adapter folder is `adapters/postgres/` (not D1)
- Sensitive inventory and auth logic runs on the server / worker, not in Vue components

## Pilot ship gate

A change belongs in the pilot if it supports this loop:

1. Configure obra + critical catalog
2. Approved initial inventory
3. WhatsApp ingreso/salida with confirmation
4. Stock query
5. Physical count + reconciliation
6. Dashboard alerts / differences

Defer OCR productivo, purchases/invoices, tareo/CAPECO, native apps, ERP/SUNAT emission.

See `docs/product/pilot-scope.md`.

## Data boundaries

- Ledger movements are immutable; balances are projections
- Multi-tenant isolation by `organizationId` (and project where required)
- Evidence files live in R2 with signed URLs — never permanent public links

## Minimize scope

Match existing patterns. Prefer trust and confirmation over clever automation.
